A '''Reindrake''' is a {{Mythic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Reindrake''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. It requires {{skill|fishing|level XXXV (35)}} to be fished up. When a '''Reindrake''' is fished up, it sends a message to all players in chat.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Reindrake''' is {{Green|25}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|0.25%|1|400|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
