== Behavior ==
A '''Reindrake''' will fly around in the air after being fished up. If players try to approach it, it will fly higher. It only takes {{HP|1}} in damage every hit.

== Drops ==
A '''Reindrake''' has a {{Chance|10%|1|10|hits}} chance to drop [[Gifts]] when damaged. The player that spawned the '''Reindrake''' will receive a [[Gift]] if another player who damages it gets one.<ref>{{Cite Discord
|user = mrkeith
|staff = yes
|url = https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1547032327916490765
|date = September 8, 2026, 7:54 PM (EST)
|text = 
<blockquote>[...] whats the exact chance for a reindrake to drop a gift when damaged, and the chance for the player who fished it up to receive a gift when someone else damages it?</blockquote>
1 in 10 to drop a gift when damaged, owner always gets a gift if another person gets one
}}</ref>

The chances to drop each Gift are below:
*{{Item|White Gift}}: {{Chance|65%|1|1.53}}
*{{Item|Green Gift}}: {{Chance|25%|1|4}}
*{{Item|Red Gift}}: {{Chance|10%|1|10}}

While {{NPCSprite|Foxy}} is Mayor or Minister with the {{Green|A Time For Giving}} perk, the '''Reindrake''' can also drop {{Item|Party Gift}}s, with the following probabilities:

