== Tips ==
*Players that do not deal enough damage to a '''Reindrake''' may not earn [[Bestiary]] progress for it unless they fished it up.
** {{Item|Explosive Arrow}}s can help with dealing more damage.
** Dealing at least one melee or magic damage hit to a '''Reindrake''' will guarantee Bestiary progress.

== Trivia ==
* The '''Reindrake''' is the only [[Sea Creature]] that triggers a server-wide announcement when caught.
* Despite being an {{Item|Ender Dragon}}, '''Reindrake''' does not have the {{mt|Airborne}} mob type because there is a limit of three mob types per mob.
** The {{mt|Airborne}} mob type would also be essentially cosmetic alongside the {{mt|Shielded}} mob type.
* The player who fished up the '''Reindrake''' will get on average {{Item|White Gift|{{#EXPR: 2500 * 1/10 * 0.65 round 3}}}},  {{Item|Green Gift|{{#EXPR: 2500 * 1/10 * 0.25 round 3}}}}, and {{Item|Red Gift|{{#EXPR: 2500 * 1/10 * 0.1 round 3}}}}, worth {{BZC|{{#EXPR: 2500 * 1/10 * 0.65 round 3}} White Gift|{{#EXPR: 2500 * 1/10 * 0.25 round 3}} Green Gift|{{#EXPR: 2500 * 1/10 * 0.1 round 3}} Red Gift}}.

